  "decision_rule": "Run exactly three fresh pairs per condition, gated on all three explicit-zero controls. Retain all outcomes and disagreements. Three repetitions are robustness checks of one candidate mechanism, not independent defects. A null/omitted difference from zero supports an input counterfactual only if other starting business fields, fixtures and actor match. No new-defect label without source/requirements and prior-issue checks. No automatic outcome-seeking reruns."
